#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:9 f30eeb4f9d614eddaebce019ac14ad74
msgid "Soaring"
msgstr "热升气流飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:14 ee84451b7c01459da9ff5922c2743cd7
msgid ""
"The autonomous soaring functionality in ArduPilot allows the plane to "
"respond to rising air current (thermals) in order to extend endurance and "
"gain altitude with minimal use of the motor (soaring). Its full technical "
"description is available in"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中的自主热升气流飞行功能允许飞机响应上升气流（热气流）以延长续航并以最少的电机使用量获得高度（热升气流飞行）。其完整技术描述见"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:18 1de75bccb8e6497181db123fa18d181c
msgid ""
"*S. Tabor, I. Guilliard, A. Kolobov.* `ArduSoar: an Open-Source Thermalling "
"Controller for Resource-Constrained Autopilots "
"<https://arxiv.org/abs/1802.08215/>`_. *International Conference on "
"Intelligent Robots and Systems (IROS), 2018.*"
msgstr ""
"*S. Tabor, I. Guilliard, A. Kolobov.* `ArduSoar: an Open-Source Thermalling "
"Controller for Resource-Constrained Autopilots "
"<https://arxiv.org/abs/1802.08215/>`_. *International Conference on "
"Intelligent Robots and Systems (IROS), 2018.*"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:20 56cf1483cb734de88d348338b91ae1ba
msgid ""
"Use of an airspeed sensor is strongly recommended in order to obtain optimum"
" performance. Use without a sensor could yield unsatisfactory results. "
"Consistent operation without an airspeed sensor is a pending future "
"development."
msgstr "强烈建议使用空速传感器以获得最优性能。不使用传感器可能导致不理想的结果。无空速传感器的一致运行是未来待开发的功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:24 53c6bcccbdae48bb9aed1851d61f133a
msgid ""
"This picture shows the different phases of flight when using the soaring "
"functionality:"
msgstr "此图展示了使用热升气流飞行功能时的不同飞行阶段："

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:27 c354c03378b247eba9780e1e2551c0e3
msgid ""
"If modes AUTO, FBWB or CRUISE are entered, and Soaring is enabled, the "
"throttle is set to zero provided the aircraft is above "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` altitude and the aircraft then begins "
"gliding."
msgstr ""
"若进入 AUTO、FBWB 或 CRUISE 模式且已启用热升气流飞行，则在飞机高于 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>`"
" 高度时油门设为零，飞机开始滑翔。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:28 193249e8a54c41229b69ac11f9d0859e
msgid ""
"If the aircraft descends to :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` altitude, "
"throttle is re-enabled and the aircraft will begin to climb to the altitude "
"of the next waypoint, in AUTO, or to :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>`"
" altitude in CRUISE or FBWB. In AUTO, if the waypoint altitude is less than "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` altitude, then Soaring can not begin"
" before reaching the waypoint. If it is above "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` altitude, then Soaring can occur "
"once that altitude has been reached."
msgstr ""
"若飞机下降至 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` 高度，则重新启用油门，飞机将开始爬升至 AUTO "
"模式下一个航点的高度，或在 CRUISE 或 FBWB 模式下爬升至 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` "
"高度。在 AUTO 模式下，若航点高度低于 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` "
"高度，则在到达航点前无法开始热升气流飞行。若高于 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` "
"高度，则一旦达到该高度即可开始热升气流飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:29 f79cf8cbc3eb41b3b4920d61d9ab8e40
msgid ""
"When the aircraft reaches :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` altitude, "
"throttle is set to zero again."
msgstr "当飞机达到 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` 高度时，油门再次设为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:30 328cd0eeba1f4ccfb4ff29fda4b26f25
msgid ""
"If, during gliding flight, the air is estimated to be rising at more than "
":ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>` and the :ref:`RC switch position<soaring_rc-"
"switch>` allows it, the aircraft will automatically enter THERMAL mode. "
"While in THERMAL mode the aircraft will adjust the circling position to "
"better centre the thermal."
msgstr ""
"若在滑翔飞行期间，空气估计上升速率超过 :ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>` 且 :ref:`RC "
"开关位置<soaring_rc-switch>` 允许，飞机将自动进入 THERMAL 模式。在 THERMAL "
"模式下，飞机将调整盘旋位置以更好地居中热气流。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:32 62f6f698ccd64e508ca92c6e2d85aa53
msgid "THERMAL mode is exited under the following conditions:"
msgstr "THERMAL 模式在以下条件下退出："

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:34 3787cd3c423140e7a90b4c5db2b27357
msgid ":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MAX<SOAR_ALT_MAX>` is reached."
msgstr "达到 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MAX<SOAR_ALT_MAX>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:35 21f5f4290f0047dfb7692e636e8ae28b
msgid ":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` is reached."
msgstr "达到 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:36 7a65a9e086b540c58d94bc5e698924f8
msgid "Flight mode is changed by the pilot."
msgstr "飞手更改飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:37 c212da64146a4a198c6854054f627f11
msgid ""
"The estimate of achievable climb rate falls below "
":ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>`, and thermalling has lasted at least "
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_THML_S<SOAR_MIN_THML_S>` seconds."
msgstr ""
"可实现爬升速率的估计低于 :ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>`，且热升气流飞行已持续至少 "
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_THML_S<SOAR_MIN_THML_S>` 秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:39 1ff9f20bb11949c388d5afa9e4c4b18b
msgid ""
"The aircraft drifts more than :ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>` - see "
":ref:`Limit maximum distance from home<soaring_maximum-distance-from-home>`"
msgstr ""
"飞机偏移超过 :ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>` —— 参见 :ref:`限制距 Home "
"的最大距离<soaring_maximum-distance-from-home>`"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:41 ede17960324146358eedde1ceac2c164
msgid ""
"The flight mode will be returned to whatever it was before THERMAL was "
"triggered."
msgstr "飞行模式将恢复为触发 THERMAL 之前的模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:44 2da56f2bb3eb40a0a3af07a263b74f22
msgid "Airspeed Control"
msgstr "空速控制"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:46 58afe9b8075a470099e4949ad2488d50
msgid ""
"When in SOARING, the target airspeed while cruising is set via throttle "
"stick position for FBWB and CRUISE modes, even while gliding. For AUTO mode,"
" it is set at  :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`, unless the "
":ref:`SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD<SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD>` parameter is set to a non-zero value"
" (\"0\" is default). If it is set to \"-1\", then the :ref:`soaring-speed-"
"to-fly` computed value will be used. If greater than zero, then that value "
"in meters/sec will be used for target airspeed."
msgstr ""
"在热升气流飞行模式下，FBWB 和 CRUISE 模式的巡航目标空速通过油门杆位置设定，即使在滑翔时也如此。对于 AUTO 模式，目标空速由 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` 设定，除非 "
":ref:`SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD<SOAR_CRSE_ARSPD>` 参数设为非零值（默认为 「0」）。若设为 「-1」，则使用 "
":ref:`soaring-speed-to-fly` 计算值。若大于零，则使用该值（单位：米/秒）作为目标空速。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:48 ccfaa4b1870b4cbf8563390991f0bde7
msgid ""
"While in THERMAL mode, the target airspeed will be "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`, unless the "
":ref:`SOAR_THML_ARSPD<SOAR_THML_ARSPD>` parameter is set to a non-zero value"
" (\"0\" is default). Then that value in meters/sec will be used for target "
"airspeed instead."
msgstr ""
"在 THERMAL 模式下，目标空速为 :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`，除非 "
":ref:`SOAR_THML_ARSPD<SOAR_THML_ARSPD>` 参数设为非零值（默认为 "
"「0」），则使用该值（单位：米/秒）作为目标空速。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:52 3ca2c2f0b71a41498daa312695a0b5f9
msgid "Hardware"
msgstr "硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:54 1affef07cd544fa1bb51421abbdef78c
msgid ""
"To use your plane for soaring, it should ideally be a glider type aircraft "
"with a good lift to drag ratio and be equipped with an airspeed sensor."
msgstr "要将您的飞机用于热升气流飞行，理想情况下应是升阻比良好的滑翔机类型飞机，并配备空速传感器。"

