msgstr "启用"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:81 60d520e5ed5140a5a163a030c9956c0e
msgid ""
"Set the parameter :ref:`SOAR_ENABLE<SOAR_ENABLE>` to 1 and refresh the "
"parameters. This will allow the other SOAR parameters to appear in the GCS."
msgstr "将参数 :ref:`SOAR_ENABLE<SOAR_ENABLE>` 设为 1 并刷新参数。这将允许其他 SOAR 参数在地面站中显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:85 ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:186
#: 944c5f5b36384f4a8bb1b6d65251cca2 e3f2aae99723468c943dafe6eb47742d
msgid "Drag Polar"
msgstr "阻力极线"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:87 71d049aae18847afadecb1a96bcd147c
msgid ""
"To work out how fast the air is rising or sinking the autopilot needs to "
"know the aircraft's sink rate for a given airspeed in still air. This is "
"related to the drag polar of the plane and is specified using the SOAR_POLAR"
" parameters. :ref:`SOAR_POLAR_K<SOAR_POLAR_K>` is the most important one to "
"set initially and is calculated using the following formula:"
msgstr ""
"为计算空气上升或下沉的速度，飞控需要了解飞机在静止空气中特定空速下的下沉速率。这与飞机的阻力极线相关，使用 SOAR_POLAR "
"参数指定。:ref:`SOAR_POLAR_K<SOAR_POLAR_K>` 是最重要的初始设置参数，使用以下公式计算："

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:93 b88bae78def74beaae9ff000e08b8e2a
msgid ""
":ref:`SOAR_POLAR_K<SOAR_POLAR_K>` = 16*Weight/Area (weight in kg, area in "
"metres squared)."
msgstr ":ref:`SOAR_POLAR_K<SOAR_POLAR_K>` = 16 * 重量/面积（重量单位：kg，面积单位：平方米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:96 246881d1925945ebb38ee5a2c7b54a98
msgid ""
":ref:`SOAR_POLAR_K<SOAR_POLAR_K>` = 703*Weight/Area (weight in oz, area in "
"inches squared)."
msgstr ":ref:`SOAR_POLAR_K<SOAR_POLAR_K>` = 703 * 重量/面积（重量单位：oz，面积单位：平方英寸）。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:99 56138b464b03415a9f30dc79edb535fd
msgid "Calculating the other parameters is explained under tuning."
msgstr "其他参数的计算在调参部分说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:104 0217d87f37e443d9a8fc0db20deccdbc
msgid "RC switch (Optional)"
msgstr "RC 开关（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:106 437962ce68de4adfb08183a17da46b01
msgid ""
"You can use a 3-position RC switch to control when the autopilot can use "
"soaring. Set the parameter RCX_OPTION parameter for the desired channel to "
"SOAR (index 88) - see :ref:`Auxiliary Functions <common-auxiliary-"
"functions>`. The 3 positions have the following effect."
msgstr ""
"可使用三档 RC 开关控制飞控何时可以使用热升气流飞行。将所需通道的 RCX_OPTION 参数设为 SOAR（索引 88）—— 参见 "
":ref:`辅助功能 <common-auxiliary-functions>`。三个位置的效果如下。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:108 cec5a498d15847478b0efe81107f710f
msgid ""
"Low. Soaring is disabled (equivalent to setting SOAR_ENABLE = 0). Throttle "
"will be used as normal. Switching to this from either of the positions "
"below, will disable Soaring and maintain the current flight mode."
msgstr ""
"低位。禁用热升气流飞行（等效于设置 SOAR_ENABLE = 0）。油门将正常使用。从以下任一位置切换至此位置将禁用热升气流飞行并保持当前飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:110 85878e977c714ae9bf28f3eb30a4d5ed
msgid ""
"Mid. Soaring will have control over throttle. The mode will not "
"automatically change to THERMAL based on detected rising air. However, when "
"manually set to THERMAL mode using RC controller or GCS, the autopilot will "
"try to follow rising air currents. It will still restore the previous mode "
"if the aircraft is not climbing, or if it drifts too far (see below)."
msgstr ""
"中位。热升气流飞行将控制油门。模式不会根据探测到的上升气流自动切换到 THERMAL。但是，当使用 RC 控制器或地面站手动设置为 THERMAL "
"模式时，飞控将尝试跟随上升气流。若飞机未爬升或偏移太远（见下文），仍会恢复到之前的模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:112 de2c04e678484930ab86bd017bdaef45
msgid ""
"High. Fully automatic mode changes to THERMAL from AUTO, FBWB or CRUISE "
"modes in response to detected rising air, and following of rising air "
"currents."
msgstr "高位。在 AUTO、FBWB 或 CRUISE 模式下，响应探测到的上升气流，自动切换至 THERMAL 并跟随上升气流。"

