#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:125 901d5f79baff46f7a608c4998d7262e1
msgid ""
"When in THERMAL mode, changing the switch position between Mid and High "
"positions commands exiting thermalling and restoring the previous mode."
msgstr "在 THERMAL 模式下，在中位和高位之间切换开关位置，将命令退出热升气流飞行并恢复到之前的模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:127 4ea5d1aac00a4b34a32a90574c1e9bd1
msgid ""
"When climbing back to altitude under throttle, changing the switch position "
"to Low and back aborts the climb and starts gliding."
msgstr "在使用油门爬升回高度时，将开关切换到低位再切回将中止爬升并开始滑翔。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:131 5ef5c7ab44fb4b62a85ec56791974ba4
msgid "Set limits"
msgstr "设置限制"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:133 698a9b716ba04458bcebf392473ee8bb
msgid ""
"Because the soaring feature can follow rising air as required to gain "
"altitude, it is important to set limits to avoid it leaving the original "
"flight area completely. This is especially important in windy conditions as "
"the autopilot will try to follow thermals downwind. There are three ways to "
"set limits."
msgstr ""
"由于热升气流飞行功能可以根据需要跟随上升气流以获得高度，因此设置限制以避免飞机完全离开原始飞行区域非常重要。在有风的情况下尤其重要，因为飞控会尝试跟随热气流顺风飞行。有三种设置限制的方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:136 b443f3b9d8c640a7af8e14a14acd9aeb
msgid "Altitude limits"
msgstr "高度限制"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:138 15d5ca5a54494fc9b3206f4baff42ed1
msgid ""
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MAX<SOAR_ALT_MAX>` sets the altitude you want the autopilot "
"to stop thermalling. :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` sets the minimum "
"altitude you want the autopilot to descend to while gliding."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MAX<SOAR_ALT_MAX>` "
"设置希望飞控停止热升气流飞行的高度。:ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` 设置希望飞控在滑翔时下降到的最低高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:143 5803f793fcbc445daeeeb07616824a26
msgid "Spatial limits"
msgstr "空间限制"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:145 b9b4658b7dc44cccaa9ed45cc276b967
msgid ""
"The parameter :ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>` can be used to limit how"
" far (in metres) the aircraft can drift while in THERMAL mode. If the "
"aircraft reaches this limit in THERMAL mode, it will revert to the original "
"flight mode."
msgstr ""
"参数 :ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>` 可用于限制飞机在 THERMAL "
"模式下可偏移的距离（单位：米）。若飞机在 THERMAL 模式下达到此限制，将恢复到原始飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:147 97529051331141c9adbe3bd7e46f9ef3
msgid ""
"If the original flight mode was FBWB or CRUISE mode, the drift distance is "
"measured from the location THERMAL was entered."
msgstr "若原始飞行模式为 FBWB 或 CRUISE 模式，偏移距离从进入 THERMAL 的位置开始测量。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:149 1413dc6eee3247ed885a682123876b81
msgid ""
"If the original flight mode was AUTO mode, the drift distance is measured "
"from the closest point on the mission segment to where THERMAL was entered. "
"Drift sideways or backwards, but not along the original mission track, is "
"counted. This allows thermalling to continue if the wind is moving the "
"aircraft in the direction of the next waypoint."
msgstr ""
"若原始飞行模式为 AUTO 模式，偏移距离从进入 THERMAL "
"处最近任务段上的点开始测量，计算侧向或向后的偏移，但不计算沿原始任务航迹方向的偏移。若风将飞机向下一个航点方向吹，则热升气流飞行可继续。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:153 c35130c530274336a3a29aeae180ee74
msgid ""
"The image below shows a scenerio where the mission track is north to south "
"and the wind is causing thermals to drift east to west. The aircraft will "
"follow them but will respect :ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>`. Note "
"that sometimes it will go a little beyond  "
":ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>` as it lines up its heading to the next"
" waypoint before reverting to AUTO mode."
msgstr ""
"下图展示了任务航迹为南北方向而风使热气流向东西方向漂移的场景。飞机将跟随热气流但会遵守 "
":ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>`。注意有时会稍微超过 "
":ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>`，因为在恢复至 AUTO 模式前需要将航向对准下一个航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:158 1adebad445d449498216a852be8a33c4
msgid ""
"If using FBWB or CRUISE mode, the parameter "
":ref:`SOAR_MAX_RADIUS<SOAR_MAX_RADIUS>` can be used to trigger RTL if the "
"aircraft is more than this distance from home when in THERMAL mode. Note "
"that this parameter won't stop the aircraft from exceeding this distance "
"before it enters THERMAL mode."
msgstr ""
"若使用 FBWB 或 CRUISE 模式，参数 :ref:`SOAR_MAX_RADIUS<SOAR_MAX_RADIUS>` 可用于在 THERMAL"
" 模式下飞机距 Home 超过此距离时触发 RTL。注意此参数不会阻止飞机在进入 THERMAL 模式前超过此距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:160 1d40a8244e9c43d0b741c9fffe859287
msgid ""
":ref:`Geofence <geofencing>` can be used as a last line of defence. Set it "
"up in the usual way."
msgstr ":ref:`地理围栏 <geofencing>` 可作为最后一道防线。按常规方式设置即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:165 b4037a8f7c6e489b8ffaac736e15c2a2
msgid "Tuning"
msgstr "调参"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:168 3404a7faa9e54e0ca3d275454b608a30
msgid "Triggering lift"
msgstr "触发上升气流"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:170 ebc4e314fc34413c9aa6cb0c3b7873dc
msgid ""
":ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>` controls when the mode will be changed to "
"THERMAL. The default of 0.7m/s may be too low if you fly in strong "
"conditions. Increasing this value makes the aircraft more \"picky\" about "
"the lift it will try to circle in."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>` 控制何时将模式切换至 THERMAL。默认值 0.7 m/s "
"在强风条件下可能太低。增大此值使飞机对盘旋的上升气流更「挑剔」。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:175 e288bb59c495433295ba2ac268f7802c
msgid "Thermalling bank angle"
msgstr "热升气流坡度角"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:177 1cbeb62d3a3c41d8894214c9625423f0
msgid ""
"The parameter :ref:`SOAR_THML_BANK<SOAR_THML_BANK>` sets the bank angle when"
" thermalling. 30 - 45 degrees works well depending on the size of the "
"thermals in your area."
msgstr ""
"参数 :ref:`SOAR_THML_BANK<SOAR_THML_BANK>` 设置热升气流飞行时的坡度角。根据您所在地区热气流的大小，30 至 45"
" 度效果良好。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:179 0b30f49cd8534d37ae1dc850be295bd1
msgid ""
"If the aircraft is not achieving this average bank angle when thermalling, "
"you should check -"
msgstr "若飞机在热升气流飞行时未能达到此平均坡度角，应检查——"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:181 78a17c089c5d4ed19cd94486a239022b
msgid ""
"that the limiting bank angle :ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>` is set a "
"bit larger than SOAR_THML_BANK (note the units are different) to give some "
"room for manoeuvring;"
msgstr ""
"限制坡度角 :ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>` 的设置应比 SOAR_THML_BANK "
"稍大（注意单位不同），以留出机动空间；"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:183 86bf0c1106b14568934d3bea59be932a
msgid ""
"that the navigation parameter NAVL1_PERIOD is no larger than the time needed"
" for a complete turn at the specified bank angle."
msgstr "导航参数 NAVL1_PERIOD 不应大于在指定坡度角完成一圈转弯所需的时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:188 e4bf885f81e74f2c90ba8f0dac79cabc
msgid ""
"While the default settings for :ref:`SOAR_POLAR_B<SOAR_POLAR_B>` and "
":ref:`SOAR_POLAR_CD0<SOAR_POLAR_CD0>` should be OK for most foamie-style "
"glider aircraft, improving the accuracy of these parameters will improve how"
" your aircraft detects and centres lift. You can use `this spreadsheet "
"<https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1WA9CXRSPBc6mFydhQ3O_2SeDrQoFH1UrdiXd0PJ-"
"zE4/edit?usp=sharing>`__ to calculate better values from glide tests."
msgstr ""
"虽然 :ref:`SOAR_POLAR_B<SOAR_POLAR_B>` 和 :ref:`SOAR_POLAR_CD0<SOAR_POLAR_CD0>`"
" 的默认设置对大多数泡沫滑翔机应该没问题，但提高这些参数的精确度将改善飞机探测和居中上升气流的能力。可以使用 `此电子表格 "
"<https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1WA9CXRSPBc6mFydhQ3O_2SeDrQoFH1UrdiXd0PJ-"
"zE4/edit?usp=sharing>`__ 从滑翔测试中计算更好的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:193 2c0960cb73084b8aa447799fb118b585
msgid "Time hysteresis"
msgstr "时间滞后"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:195 329475f69c2a4178a2db24460dcb3b28
msgid "Adding hysteresis can reduce the frequency of mode changes."
msgstr "添加滞后可减少模式切换的频率。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:197 2a6b88b5401f46f6882529e4fb510bcd
msgid ""
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_THML_S<SOAR_MIN_THML_S>`: Minimum time to remain in THERMAL "
"once entered for a thermal before exiting due to low lift or altitude "
"limits."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_THML_S<SOAR_MIN_THML_S>`：进入 THERMAL 后，在因低上升气流或高度限制退出前，保持在 "
"THERMAL 的最短时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:199 cc3ccd3b8e2146d2800c60a0cb96a0b6
msgid ""
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_CRSE_S<SOAR_MIN_CRSE_S>`: Minimum time to remain in glide "
"after exiting THERMAL due to low lift or altitude limits before entering "
"mode again, or when entering Soaring initially."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_CRSE_S<SOAR_MIN_CRSE_S>`：因低上升气流或高度限制退出 THERMAL 后，在再次进入 "
"THERMAL 模式或初次进入热升气流飞行前，保持滑翔的最短时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:202 5cb31beb134c47d6b6cfef58f318b1f2
msgid "TECS Tuning"
msgstr "TECS 调参"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:206 d85bc53732b1483e949bc651d503d264
msgid ""
"In firmware revisions before 4.1, it was necessary to set "
":ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT<TECS_SPDWEIGHT>` to 2.0 when using soaring. This is now"
" handled automatically."
msgstr ""
"在 4.1 之前的固件版本中，使用热升气流飞行时需要将 :ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT<TECS_SPDWEIGHT>` 设为 "
"2.0。现在已自动处理。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:209 01d18cca8e604c80ba5f616d5dcbb475
msgid ""
"For best results the TECS needs to be set up to fly the aircraft at a "
"consistent airspeed when gliding."
msgstr "为获得最佳结果，TECS 需要设置为在滑翔时以一致的空速飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:212 b0b98fa6839d4882a9c9be9161f9796c
msgid ""
"If your aircraft has trouble maintaining airspeed accurately you can tune it"
" by confirming that :ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT<TECS_SPDWEIGHT>` is set to 2.0, "
":ref:`SOAR_ENABLE<SOAR_ENABLE>` to 1 and set :ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>`"
" to a large number, say 50.0, or use the :ref:`RC switch<soaring_rc-switch-"
"upcoming>` to inhibit mode changes. This means that the aircraft will glide "
"but will never begin thermalling. Set "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` to an altitude high enough to allow "
"a good length of time to be spent gliding."
msgstr ""
"若飞机难以精确保持空速，可以通过确认 :ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT<TECS_SPDWEIGHT>` 设为 "
"2.0、:ref:`SOAR_ENABLE<SOAR_ENABLE>` 设为 1，并将 :ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>` "
"设为较大数值（如 50.0），或使用 :ref:`RC 开关<soaring_rc-switch-upcoming>` "
"抑制模式切换来调参。这意味着飞机将滑翔但不会进入热升气流飞行。将 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` "
"设置为足够高的高度以允许足够长的滑翔时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:219 6358b57c62494d0d966ce2be360021d0
msgid ""
"Launch the aircraft and put it in AUTO mode. It should climb to "
":ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` and then begin a gliding descent. "
"Watch the telemetry graphs or look at the Dataflash logs after the flight. "
"Is the aircraft maintaining the demanded airspeed? The actual and demanded "
"airspeed can be seen in the onboard log as ``TECS.sp`` and ``TECS.spdem``, "
"and via telemetry you can use ``NAV_CONTROLLER_OUTPUT.aspd_error``. Problems"
" can usually be fixed by increasing ``PTCH2SRV_IMAX`` and "
":ref:`TECS_INTEG_GAIN<TECS_INTEG_GAIN>` to achieve good airspeed tracking in"
" gliding flight."
msgstr ""
"起飞飞机并切换至 AUTO 模式。飞机应爬升至 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF<SOAR_ALT_CUTOFF>` "
"然后开始滑翔下降。观察数传图表或飞行后查看 Dataflash 日志。飞机是否保持了指令空速？实际和指令空速可在机载日志中的 ``TECS.sp`` 和"
" ``TECS.spdem`` 中查看，通过数传可使用 ``NAV_CONTROLLER_OUTPUT.aspd_error``。通常可以通过增大 "
"``PTCH2SRV_IMAX`` 和 :ref:`TECS_INTEG_GAIN<TECS_INTEG_GAIN>` 来改善滑翔飞行中的空速跟踪。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:226 7375a16806dd4fbda1ca34e34a7dd954
msgid "Speed to Fly Feature"
msgstr "飞行速度功能"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:234 2732d5128b0e4ad6a18ae48771a8bb55
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:237 f6a69d8b5ccf45acbf77f07e0e6b49bd
msgid "MAVLINK Telemetry"
msgstr "MAVLink 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:239 131b422ca4b74ac5be8d4b8b4ef260e6
msgid ""
"Currently, the only effect on telemetry is that when soaring is active the "
"climb rate item (VFR_HUD.climb) is altered. Rather that the estimated "
"vertical speed of the aircraft, the estimated vertical speed of the air mass"
" is sent. This field is used by Mission Planner and OpenTX radios to produce"
" vario audio output."
msgstr ""
"目前，热升气流飞行对数传的唯一影响是在热升气流飞行激活时，爬升速率项（VFR_HUD.climb）会发生变化。发送的不是飞机的估计垂直速度，而是空气团的估计垂直速度。此字段被"
" Mission Planner 和 OpenTX 遥控器用于产生航空仪音频输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:242 ba8fc4c041d6432b9d69ec00f6955c0b
msgid "Use of TECS synthetic airspeed"
msgstr "使用 TECS 合成空速"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-4_1.rst:244 5b804b9c94df419b8823e0f06aa54a12
msgid ""
"If your plane can't accommodate an airspeed sensor, it is possible to use "
"the TECS synthetic airspeed estimate "
":ref:`TECS_SYNAIRSPEED<TECS_SYNAIRSPEED>`. Make sure you read the warning "
"regarding this feature before deciding to use it. To use this feature, set "
"the parameter :ref:`TECS_SYNAIRSPEED<TECS_SYNAIRSPEED>` to 1."
msgstr ""
"若您的飞机无法安装空速传感器，可以使用 TECS 合成空速估计 "
":ref:`TECS_SYNAIRSPEED<TECS_SYNAIRSPEED>`。在决定使用之前，请务必阅读关于此功能的警告。要使用此功能，请将参数 "
":ref:`TECS_SYNAIRSPEED<TECS_SYNAIRSPEED>` 设为 1。"
